    {
      "duration_ms": 13000,
      "caption": "On a mispredict, TAGE allocates an entry in a longer-history table.",
      "narration": "When the provider is wrong, the predictor allocates a new entry in a table with longer history, so the next occurrence of that pattern can be learned. Useful bits guard good entries.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "Learning",
